WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.434 line:92%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.135 size:78% position:39% line:92%
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:03.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
How was everybody's
last two weeks?

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:04.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wonderful!
Mine were, too.

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:05.672 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:08.608 size:88% position:44%
Congress returned today
after a two-week recess.

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:09.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Not much.
Just hung out,"

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:11.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
said Matt Gaetz,
before anyone could talk.

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:14.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
According to a new report,

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:15.782 line:92%
Florida Congressman Matt Gaetz

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:18.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
used the cash transfer
app Venmo

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:20.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
to send an accused
sex trafficker $900,

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
who then paid three young wome
for "tuition and school,"

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:27.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is a pretty weak attempt
to cover your tracks.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:30.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's like leaving your walle
at a crime scene,

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:32.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
but wiping
your fingerprints off it.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:34.200 align:start size:94% position:6%
The House Ethics Committee
announced Friday

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.201 line:92%
it will launch an investigatio

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
into Republican
Congressman Matt Gaetz

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.204 size:88% position:44% line:92%
over allegations that he

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.907 align:start size:94% position:6%
"may have engaged
in sexual misconduct

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:41.608 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and/or illicit drug use,

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:44.644
shared inappropriate image
or videos on the House floor

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:46.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
misused state
identification records,

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
converted campaign funds
to personal use,

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:51.584 align:start size:94% position:6%
and/or accepted a bribe,
improper gratuity,

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:54.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
or impermissible gift,"
or as Republicans call it,

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:55.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
running for reelection.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:58.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
New York City
mayoral candidate Andrew Yan

00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:00.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
marked National Pet Day
yesterday

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
by tweeting that his family ha
to give away their dog

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:05.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
after one of his sons
became allergic.

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:09.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, I can't wait to see what
he posts for Mother's Day.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:10.537 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:11.671 size:81% position:41% line:92%
He's the new Scollins.

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:12.972 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He's ruining days.

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:14.908 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:18.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
Two weeks off,
I felt like days were safe

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:19.579 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:21.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
Britain's Prince Harry
is reportedly set

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:23.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
to travel back to the UK
this week

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.685 align:start size:94% position:6%
for his grandfather
Prince Philip's funeral.

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:28.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
Apparently, as a latch-ditch
effort to revive him.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Philip ]
Why, you little piece of -

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.693 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:34.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know
if we should've done that

00:01:34.828 --> 00:01:37.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
on a night John Oliver's
going to be on.

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because he's probably
pretty beat up about it all.

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:41.601 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:45.605
After recently calling on hi
supporters to boycott Coca-Col

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:47.607 align:start size:94% position:6%
and other companies
that criticized

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:48.475 line:92%
Georgia's new voting law,

00:01:48.475 --> 00:01:50.710
former President Trump
was recently photographed

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.246
with a bottle of Diet Coke
and, somewhere out there,

00:01:53.246 --> 00:01:57.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
Robert Mueller gently pumped
his fist and whispered --

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:58.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Mueller ]
Got 'im.

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:01.721
The Brewers and Miller Lit
are now selling candles,

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:04.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
which include scents
such as Dive Bar,

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.592 line:92%
Beer Garden, and Game Day.

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:09.195 size:81% position:41%
Of course, their beer
will remain unscented.

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:09.896 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:12.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
According to reports,
a single person showed up

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:15.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
to a so-called
white lives matter march

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:17.537 line:92%
and rally on Sunday in New York.

00:02:17.537 --> 00:02:18.304 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So, less of a rally

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:22.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
and more of someone angril
going for a walk.

00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:26.212 size:78% position:39%
Karen wrote that joke
and I like when Karen

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:28.181 line:92%
writes jokes about Karens.

00:02:28.181 --> 00:02:30.817 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:33.586
And, finally, a documentar
streaming service announce

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:35.922
over the weekend that it's
looking for three people

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:38.992 align:start size:94% position:6%
