of true crime documentaries.

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:41.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
Though, I'll be more impressed
if you can find

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:42.495 size:88% position:44% line:92%
three people who aren't.

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:45.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that was the monologue
everybody.

